@startuml FoodRescue_Request_Allocation

title FoodRescue — Request Approval & Allocation Activity

start

:Recipient submits food request;
:Set request status to Pending;
:Notify donor;

:Donor / Administrator reviews request;

if (Request acceptable?) then (Yes)

    :Approve request;
    :Check available food quantity;

    if (Quantity available?) then (Yes)

        :Create allocation;
        :Set request status to Allocated;
        :Reserve allocated quantity;
        :Notify recipient;
        :Begin pickup coordination;

    else (No)

        :Reject allocation;
        :Notify recipient;
        :Update request status;

    endif

else (No)

    :Reject request;
    :Set request status to Rejected;
    :Notify recipient;

endif

stop

@enduml